title: Compound VALET
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Smith
    given-names: Joan C.
  - family-names: Sheltzer
    given-names: Jason M.
url: "https://compoundvalet.ai"
license-url: "https://polyformproject.org/licenses/noncommercial/1.0.0"
abstract: >-
  Compound VALET (Verification Agent for Literature-based Evaluation of Targets)
  is a multi-agent literature-verification pipeline for evaluating whether
  published evidence supports a small-molecule compound's stated target, together
  with Paper Query for checking compounds used in research manuscripts.
